    "schemaVersion": 1,
    "id": "pf2e:background:martial-disciple",
    "kind": "background",
    "slug": "martial-disciple",
    "name": "Martial Disciple",
    "description": {
      "sourceHtml": "<p>You dedicated yourself to intense training and rigorous study to become a great warrior. The school you attended might have been a traditionalist monastery, an elite military academy, or the local branch of a prestigious mercenary organization.</p>\n<p>Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to <strong>Strength</strong> or <strong>Dexterity</strong>, and one is a free attribute boost.</p>\n<p>You're trained in your choice of the Acrobatics or Athletics skill. You gain a skill feat: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Cat Fall] if you chose Acrobatics or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Quick Jump] if you chose Athletics. You're also trained in the Warfare Lore skill.</p>",
      "plainText": "You dedicated yourself to intense training and rigorous study to become a great warrior. The school you attended might have been a traditionalist monastery, an elite military academy, or the local branch of a prestigious mercenary organization. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Strength or Dexterity, and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in your choice of the Acrobatics or Athletics skill. You gain a skill feat: if you chose Acrobatics or if you chose Athletics. You're also trained in the Warfare Lore skill."
    },
